{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "It Fell From the Sky!",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7240ebd5b9b04ede86e42184702fc31fe5aa9cd2fd87860d89031ce290633f85",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）\n9:00 A.M. / Overcast\n14 hours before the attack on L. G. D. Headquarters\n'Bad Guy' - 300 Meters above 'District 14' of Chernobog\nMission objective: Join forces with Rhodes Island to rescue the reconnaissance team\nAssigned assets:\n'Bad Guy' and its pilot; Rhodes Island elite operator Blaze and her team.\n14 individuals."
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_aircraft"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is your stop. Amiya and her people are nearby!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Was it really okay to drop the team outside the city? You're gonna go down there by yourself?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come on, it's a lot better for them to be out there clearing a path and pushing back Reunion's pursuit forces than to fight here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Okay. The terrain down there is pretty rough. This is as far as I can take you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...At least let me put down a rope for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When have you ever seen me use a rope?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're just gonna go for it again, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go for what? What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Every time we have a mission together, you go off and do crazy stuff while I sit in the cockpit on pins and needles and watch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm kind of used to it, but that doesn't change the fact that you're way too reckless out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That just goes to show you what a good rapport you, me, and my team have!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Rapport my ass! Last time you demolished a town, bombed out a reservoir, and collapsed a mine!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keep the chaos on the ground please, don't bring it onto my baby!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fine, fine. I got it. But, 'Bad Guy,' really? Maybe think a little harder next time you pick a name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just jump already."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think the welcoming committee's spotted us. This is where we say goodbye, Blaze."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll wait for you by the entrance to the ruins. Be quick!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? The comms."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "HELLO?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can hear you! You don't have to yell!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh. Hi, Rhodes Islanders. I'm with the L. G. D. I've met up with your team by the ruins!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't the L. G. D. withdraw already? What are you trying to pull?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not like that Ch'en lady! Trust me, I can help you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And how should we call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Use my codename. Call me Officer Swire!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't Swire just your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blaze, can you take care of this? I'm not good with bureaucrats..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Blaze?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't look at me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get back here! Don't jump!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Didn't you tell me to jump a second ago? You can handle this. I believe in you! *Mwah*"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Pilot",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mwah my ass!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_11"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Pant* *pant*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Is she okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, it's nothing serious. Just her body temperature's a little low."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's always... low. I'm fine. I just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frostleaf, slow down. Your temperature is even lower than usual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor, pass me a bandage."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Here.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you, I'm fine. Meteorite got hit a lot harder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's okay. I'm a Sarkaz. I'm more worried about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Jessica, what is Yeti Squad doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Th- they're approaching our position! About 500 meters out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And the debris clearing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We need about fifteen more minutes. The collapsed building has a pretty complicated superstructure and we can't risk blasting here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Meteorite, get ready to fight. We have to hold this line."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Roger. Do we have a stock of bolts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. Logistics can get them for you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya, are you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...guh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did somebody leave their comms open?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is the elite operators' channel, I can open it from my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That voice...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh no. They sent her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... who is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes, who is this? And what's got her so excited?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Can she really make a difference here?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They call her Blaze. She can certainly level the whole area and leave everyone pissing themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn right it's me! But that last part is a little off."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Please... let's be serious here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where are you, Blaze? We need your support."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm right above you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just about 200 meters to go and I'll be there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't hit the machine, it's out of range!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Flying machines... they have such equipment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Make sure they do not come down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wipe out the Rhodes Island squad before their reinforcements arrive. They cannot be allowed to join forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "———Stand back!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She jumped again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She jumped again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can jump together sometime, Amiya! If you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think I'll take a rain check. Where's your team?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I left them outside the city. They'll be here in a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't hear anything over the wind. Turn off your comms!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Everyone... move to support Blaze."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, no matter what she says..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...just nod."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It dropped something..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...a person?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's only one. But keep your guard up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I sense a heat. She's using some kind of temperature Arts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hello, Reunion friends."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't like fighting other Infected. But I heard you hurt some of my Rhodes Island co-workers..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And you're still after my buddies. So I'm going to have to put a stop to that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FrostNova",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aren't you mouthy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hi. How you doing, Miss Frosty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I wanna see what happens when my hot meets your cold."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "aliases": [
        "Amiya"
